        <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="f-99_lbl" order="1" xlink:to="ft-99_46941_lbl" />
        <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="f-563_lbl" order="0" xlink:to="ft-563_47287_lbl" />
        <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="f-788_lbl" order="0" xlink:to="ft-788_47288_lbl" />
        <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="f-912_lbl" order="0" xlink:to="ft-912_47401_lbl" />
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-99_46941_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p>Energy Transfer LP (DE) owns 60% of Bayou Bridge Pipeline, LLC (DE) through its 100% ownership of ET CC Holdings, LLC (DE).</p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-563_47287_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p>Other Adjustments due to asset unitization.</p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-788_47288_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p>Other Adjustments reflect an asset reclassification that resulted in changes to the associated depreciation expense.</p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-912_47401_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p style="text-align: left"><span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); display: inline !important; float: none">The cost of service results were calculated using the Cost of Service Model.This Model calculates cost of service using the Trended Original Cost methodology promulgated by the FERC in Opinion No. 154-B, 31 FERC 61,377 (1985), as modified and clarified by subsequent rulings. </span><br /></p></link:footnote>
    </link:footnoteLink>
</xbrl>